{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55620","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十八 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生初志已酬之，怀抱怡然寂有归。\n古帙懒开缘得意，幽房长闭爲忘机。\n数行鸟阵连云没，一带泉声隔岭微。\n道合古今浑总是，何须更虑昔年非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}